row(29, 35, 'MATERIAL', f'ON THE EIGHTH DAY AN ASSEMBLY SHALL BE FOR YOU — THE WORD\'S THREE TORAH SEATS, PESACH\'S SEVENTH DAY THE THIRD; ONKELOS: A GATHERING. {HP(29, 35, (("ביום", "השמיני", "עצרת", "תהיה", "לכם"), "on the eighth day AN ASSEMBLY shall be to you — the ordinal 8; the word\'s Torah seats Leviticus 23:36 and this for Sukkot\'s eighth day, and Deuteronomy 16:8 for PESACH\'S SEVENTH (computed; six in the Bible); Leviticus 23:36 at its second seat, nine of ten shared; the Sifrei: \'withheld from leaving\' — the pilgrim held in Jerusalem overnight, the word\'s sense from Jeremiah\'s \'confined\' (36:5, 33:1), and the first day the same by the shared \'holy convocation\', 151:1"), (("כל", "מלאכת", "עבדה", "לא", "תעשו"), "all laborious work you shall not do — the sixth and last of the festival form in the two chapters"))} → {AP(29, 35, (("ביומא", "תמינאה", "כנישו", "תהי", "לכון"), "on the eighth day A GATHERING shall be to you — the assembly rendered a gathering; the same word given Shavuot at 28:26 as \'your assemblies\', cut from the shelf\'s bytes"))}. No narrative verb.')
